  (text "P1: direct-solder 4-wire pigtail (no connector)\n1=GND  2=+3V3  3=ENC_SDA  4=ENC_SCL\nto nacelle-control node — River (primary) / Simon (alternate).\nI2C pull-ups (4.7k on SDA/SCL) live at the node per datasheet Fig-18 — not on this board.\nTwo nacelles: default addr 0x06; program one to 0x46 to share a bus, or use separate buses / TCA9548A."
    (at 74.00 116.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left))
