  (text "MODE(14): internal 200kΩ pull-up, left OPEN = I2C/SSI (datasheet Fig-18).\nPUSH/OUT/Z/W/U/V unused in I2C mode (no-connect). NC pins 1-4,10.\nVDD=13, GND=16, SDA=6(A), SCL=7(B). Optional 6V TVS on VDD per Fig-18 (EMI)."
